    \centering
    \includegraphics[width=1\textwidth]{img/SDLC.pdf}
    \caption{Quantum software development life cycle and areas where developers and operators interact with quantum hardware or simulators: (1) the design and development of quantum algorithms, and (2) scheduling and executing the computation on an available and capable quantum computer.}
    \label{fig:sdlc}
