For the commonly used fidelity metrics PSNR and SSIM in the classical image SR task, 4KAgent with \textbf{ExpSR-s4-F} profile shows competitive performance compared to state-of-the-art fidelity-based methods, ranking among the top three on Set5, B100, Urban100, and Manga109 datasets. For perception-based methods, we focus more on perceptual metrics such as NIQE, CLIPIQA, MUSIQ, and MANIQA. By simply switching the profile from \textbf{ExpSR-s4-F} to \textbf{ExpSR-s4-P}, 4KAgent achieves strong performance among state-of-the-art perception-based methods, ranking among the top two across most metrics on all classical SR benchmarks.
For comparison across agentic systems, 4KAgent outperforms AgenticIR in most metrics on classical SR benchmarks, especially on the Set14 and B100 datasets. 



