            The trace functor of automorphisms of $t$-dualizable objects factors through
            \begin{equation*}
                \cC\tdblA[\TT] \simeq (\cC\ndbl[(t-1)])\ndblA[\TT]{1} \xto{\tr} \laxloops (\cC\ndbl[(t-1)]).
