The performance of the modulo algorithm in the asynchronous setting is worse than in the synchronous setting (see \rfig{3user-ettr-fixed-x2}), as additional time is required for users to rendezvous and synchronize their clocks.
On the other hand, the performance of the random algorithm remains the same in both the asynchronous and synchronous settings. Despite this, the performance of the modulo algorithm  still
