\textbf{tumor Class} & \textbf{Precision} & \textbf{Recall} & \textbf{F1-Score} \\ \hline
Glioma tumor       & 0.914            & 0.932           & 0.923           \\ \hline
Meningioma tumor   & 0.819            & 0.798           & 0.808           \\ \hline
No tumor           & 0.946            & 0.875           & 0.909           \\ \hline
Pituitary tumor    & 0.868            & 0.945           & 0.905           \\ \hline
