    \caption{Trajectories for stochastic and deterministic scenarios. Parameters: $\beta = 10, \, p=0.6,\,  N = 1000, \,T = 1000$. There are 15 iterations for deterministic map and the same number of independent simulations for stochastic dynamics.}
