		{\sc\bf Qualitative and Generalized Differentiation Properties of Optimal Value Functions with  Applications to Duality}\\[1ex]
       {\sc Vo Si Trong Long\footnote{Faculty of Mathematics and Computer
	Science, University of Science
	Ho Chi Minh City, Vietnam.}$^,$ \footnote{Vietnam National University, Ho Chi Minh City, Vietnam, (email: vstlong@hcmus.edu.vn).} {\sc Nguyen Mau   Nam}\footnote{Fariborz Maseeh Department of Mathematics and Statistics,
