The sci-CAR dataset profiles well-labeled cells, including cell lines 293T, 3T3, a 293T/3T3 cell mixture, and A549 cells after 0, 1, or 3 hours of dexamethasone treatment. We evaluate cell-type purity in sci-CAR dataset, and metacells from COEM algorithm has greater purity (0.91)
