\includegraphics[scale=1]{actaurwhol_l100.eps}
\caption{Initial activity ($a_0$) of runs starting from different zones of attractant concentration as function of wave speed for moderate wavelength. Zones are defined in each panel, which split the attractant concentration range in four roughly equal parts. The maximum error-bar in these data is $10^{-5}$. All other simulation parameters are as in Fig. \ref{fig:v100}.}
