		= Q_{f',g'}(h^{-1/2} \psi)  \\ 
	= & \int_{\Sigma} \frac{\left|(h^{-1/2} \psi)' - (f' \xi'_1+ g' \xi'_2) \partial_t (h^{-1/2} \psi) \right|^2}{h} \dx \dt  + \int_{\Sigma} 
 h \left| \partial_t (h^{-1/2} \psi) \right|^2 \dx \dt,
	\end{align*}
	%
	\[\dom \hat{Q}_{f',g'}:= \dom Q_{f',g'},\]
	%
	where 
	$(h^{-1/2} \psi)' := \partial (h^{-1/2} \psi) / \partial x$.
 Note that
