    & & & \mbox{$\baseC \!\supseteq\! \baseB$, if $\phi \Vdash_\baseC p$ and $\psi \Vdash_\baseC p$, then $\Vdash_\baseC p$}\\
(\supset) & \mbox{$\Vdash_\baseB \phi \supset \psi$ iff $\phi \Vdash_\baseB \psi$} & (\bot) & 
