    $\Vdash_\baseB \psi$} & \mbox{(Inf)} & \mbox{for $\Theta \neq \emptyset$, 
        $\Theta \Vdash_\baseB \phi$ iff, for every $\baseC \supseteq \baseB$,}  \\ 
