In this paper, we propose \sys, a resilient and adaptive data transmission approach designed to enable timely and efficient cross-facility scientific workflows. To accelerate data transmission over WANs, \sys adopts the UDP protocol instead of TCP. Since UDP lacks a built-in retransmission mechanism to recover from packet loss, \sys incorporates erasure coding to provide fault tolerance. 
