    \caption{Logarithmic plot of the absolute value of the Ricci scalar $|R(r)|$ for the exponential distribution of topological defects. The curvature is sharply peaked near the origin and decays rapidly as $r$ increases, reflecting the compact support of the geometric deformation.}
