For a fixed $j\in \lattice$, the \emph{shift map} $\sigma_j$ 
is a very well-known and widely studied CA defined as follows 
\[
%\sigma(x_{N_r(i)})=x_{i+j}, \ \ \forall %x\in\setofstates^\lattice,\ \forall i\in\lattice.
\sigma_j(x)_i=x_{i+j}, \ \ \forall x\in\setofstates^\lattice,\ \forall i\in\lattice.
